---
description: Rules for financial dashboards and summaries
globs:
  - app/**/page.tsx
  - components/dashboard/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: true
---

Every dashboard page must include:

1. Top summary metrics
2. Time-based trend
3. Breakdown by category / source
4. Notable changes
5. Detailed table or ledger
6. AI-generated summary or insights

Financial dashboard standards:

- Always support daily, weekly, monthly, yearly views where relevant
- Always compare against previous equivalent period when possible
- Always identify largest contributors to change
- Always separate income, expenses, transfers, savings, and investments
- Never merge transfers into spend analytics
- Never confuse investment contributions with expenses unless explicitly intended
- Always make cash flow and actual spend distinguishable

Insight rules:

- Show at most 3 to 5 insights prominently
- Each insight should be specific and measurable
- Insights should mention amounts, percentages, merchants, or time ranges where relevant
- Avoid generic insight text

A dashboard is successful only if a user can understand their financial state in under 30 seconds.
